on; no new Lean declaration, formal replay or independent acceptance. No effective endpoint rate or normalization of Stieltjes mass is asserted. The nonminimizing counterexample concerns pointwise positivity only.","citation_ids":["authored_r9_support_raw_curvature_negative_absolute_terminal"],"evidence_ids":["ordinary_deductions_review_20261026_r9"],"id":"support.raw_curvature_negative_absolute_terminal","kind":"claim","label":"Negative raw curvature with absolute-value terminal data","locator":"Long reasoning record #pointwise-curvature-obstruction","source_id":"authored_long_comparisons_20261024","statement":"For fixed 0<t<1, tau=1-t and x=sqrt(tau), the admissible constant coefficient gamma_c=c has Phi_c=c^(-1)log E exp(c|x+sqrt(tau)Z|). Its raw expression d_c^2-12*c*a_c*b_c^2+6*c^2*a_c^4 equals -12*a_0^3*c/tau+O(c^2), hence is negative for sufficiently small c>0. Here a,b,d are the second, third and fourth spatial derivatives; a_0=sqrt(2/(pi*tau))*exp(-x^2/(2*tau)).","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.raw_curvature_negative_absolute_terminal","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.raw_curvature_negative_absolute_terminal","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22support.raw_curvature_negative_absolute_terminal%22%2C%22support.regularity%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22support.raw_curvature_negative_absolute_terminal%22%2C%22support.regularity%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.regularity"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6